   $q$According to the author, what equipment does a simple weather station need?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A fish tank, a ruler and some tomato plants","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"A computer, a camera and a weather balloon","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A textbook, a sign-up chart and a calendar","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"A rain gauge, a thermometer and a wind vane","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A rain gauge, a thermometer and a wind vane$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 lists "a rain gauge, a thermometer" and "a wind vane." The fish tank and tomato plants are things the school already has, not parts of the station.$q$, 'draft', '785b7f77-91f6-5664-a58c-da3bfae33c0a')
